			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Add per-subsystem compile-time feature gating from tier env vars\n\nDeclare 14 subsystem Cargo features (Terminal, SCM, Debug, LanguageFeatures, Search, OutputChannel, NativeHost, TreeView, Storage, Model, FileSystem, Encryption, Tasks, Auth) in the default features set and implement the build.rs `EmitTierFeatures` pipeline. A new `emit_feature_from_tier` helper reads each `Tier*` key from `.env.Land` and emits `cargo:rustc-cfg=feature=\"...\"` when the value is neither `Disabled` nor `Node`, meaning the native Mountain handler is active.\n\nThe `IsDeclaredTierFeature` whitelist is extended to include all 14 subsystem names so unknown combinations surface as build warnings rather than silent no-ops.\n\nTogether with the existing per-subsystem `RouteTier` enum (NodeDeferred mode), this lets `#[cfg(feature = \"...\")]` gates guard native dispatch paths at compile time — a subsystem whose tier defaults to Node silently omits Mountain's handler code from the binary.\n\nAlso update Info.plist: remove Inspect flag, add ProductFlavor identifier, clear Record and Trace defaults. Rewrite README with badge tables, narrower paragraph wrapping, and a funding-section logo grid.",
			"SHA": "5bcb63a34e206f5ecc46a4127b251323654015d4"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-12T00:06:04Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1872,
				4
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Extract dispatch match logic, add terminal update property handler, and simplify README\n\nContinue the Mountain modularization effort by extracting the main IPC dispatch\nmatch block from the `mod.rs` module registry into a dedicated\n`DispatchMatch.rs` file, keeping `mod.rs` as a pure module declaration\nregistry with thin forwarding wrappers.\n\nAdd `LocalPTYUpdateProperty.rs` under `WindServiceHandlers/Terminal/` to\nimplement the `localPty:updateProperty` wire method. The handler persists\nterminal title (prop 2), override name (prop 3), and shell type (prop 5) to\nthe feature state's `ActiveTerminals` map, emitting `TerminalPropertyChanged`\nto Sky for live xterm tab label and icon updates.\n\nSimplify the README: replace the complex HTML table header and emoji deco\nwith clean markdown, consolidate sections (Overview, Key Features,\nArchitecture, Key Components, In the Land Project), flatten badge layout\nonto inline links, and replace the multi-column logo table with a compact\nimage grid in the Funding section. Remove redundant Deep Dive references\nand editorializing about Electron's RAM tax.\n\nFollows the established pattern of extracting monolithic files into\nsingle-responsibility modules seen across URI schemes, debug providers,\nLSP features, WindAdvancedSync, and CocoonManagement.",
			"SHA": "1ff126034b179833a45152d79b259b41d3a735dc"
		},
