				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1870,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Organize modules by introducing dedicated files for Scheme, DebugProvider, LanguageFeatureProvider, WindAdvancedSync, and CocoonManagement\n\nSigned-off-by: Nikola Hristov <Nikola@PlayForm.Cloud>",
			"SHA": "16c08aa0811d932fa02a890342da2da7a64c386e"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-11T22:59:36Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1870,
				19
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Modularize WindAdvancedSync and CocoonManagement into dedicated modules\n\nContinue the Mountain modularization effort by extracting monolithic implementations into focused single-responsibility modules across two subsystems:\n\nWindAdvancedSync (Source/IPC/WindAdvancedSync/):\n- 10 new modules covering the full document/Ui-state synchronization pipeline:\n  ApplyDocumentChange, BroadcastRealTimeUpdates, BroadcastUpdates,\n  CalculateSyncStatus, CheckForConflicts, New, StartPerformanceMonitoring,\n  StartSyncTask, SynchronizeDocuments, UpdateSyncStatus\n- Each module exposes a single public `Fn` entry point; WindAdvancedSync.rs\n  becomes a clean delegation layer (~200 lines down from ~900)\n- Circuit-breaker logic, conflict detection, and real-time broadcast fast-path\n  preserved in their respective modules\n\nCocoonManagement (Source/ProcessManagement/CocoonManagement/):\n- 19 new modules covering the complete Cocoon sidecar lifecycle:\n  BuildCocoonEnvironment, CocoonProcessState, ConnectToCocoonGrpc,\n  FindMatchingWorkspaceContainsPatterns, FireRootConfigActivationEvents,\n  FireWorkspaceContainsEvents, HardKillCocoon, LaunchAndManageCocoonSideCar,\n  MonitorCocoonHealthTask, PatternMatchesAnyEntry, ResolveBootstrapScript,\n  RestoreWebviewPanels, SeedOpenDocuments, SeedOpenTerminals,\n  SegmentMatch, SendInitializationHandshake, SingleSegmentMatch,\n  SpawnCocoonIoForwarders, SpawnRestartHandler, SpawnStartupActivationTask,\n  SweepStaleCocoon\n- Zombie-process sweep (Atom I6), exponential-backoff gRPC connect with\n  child-exit detection, workspaceContains pattern matching, and automatic\n  restart handler all extracted to independent, testable units\n- Original CocoonManagement.rs reduced from ~1700 lines to ~150 lines of\n  orchestration\n\nImpact: Drastically improves maintainability, enables independent unit testing\nof each subsystem component, and establishes consistent modular patterns for\nfuture Mountain development. Follows the same architectural approach as the\nprior URI scheme, debug provider, LSP feature, and Tauri IPC modularization.",
			"SHA": "5ac832301cb2362a5be618b965ada8972baaf5d3"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-11T22:55:15Z",
			"File": [
				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1855,
				74
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Modularize URI schemes, debug provider, LSP features, IPC server, and Cocoon management into dedicated modules\n\nExtract monolithic implementations into focused single-responsibility modules across multiple Mountain subsystems:\n\nURI Scheme Handlers (Source/Binary/Build/Scheme/):\n- ForwardHttpRequest, LandSchemeHandler, MimeFromExtension, ParseHttpResponse,\n  VscodeFileSchemeHandlerInner, VscodeWebviewSchemeHandlerInner\n- Each handler now lives in its own file with clear public `Fn` entry points\n- Original Scheme.rs reduced from 1300+ lines to ~100 lines of delegation\n\nDebug Provider (Source/Environment/DebugProvider/):\n- ConnectPipeServerAdapter, ConnectServerAdapter, RegisterDebugAdapterDescriptorFactory,\n  RegisterDebugConfigurationProvider, SendCommand, SpawnExecutableAdapter,\n  StartDebugging, StopDebugging\n- Trait impl in DebugProvider.rs now delegates to per-method modules\n- Eliminates 1000+ line trait implementation block\n\nLSP Language Features (Source/Environment/LanguageFeatureProvider/FeatureMethods/):\n- 31 feature methods extracted (ProvideCompletions, ProvideHover, ProvideDefinition,\n  ProvideReferences, ProvideCodeActions, ProvideCodeLenses, ProvideDocumentSymbols,\n  ProvideWorkspaceSymbols, ProvideSignatureHelp, ProvideDocumentFormattingEdits,\n  ProvideDocumentRangeFormattingEdits, ProvideOnTypeFormattingEdits, ProvideRenameEdits,\n  PrepareRename, ProvideDocumentHighlights, ProvideDocumentLinks, ProvideFoldingRanges,\n  ProvideSelectionRanges, ProvideSemanticTokensFull, ProvideInlayHints,\n  ProvideInlineCompletionItems, ProvideFileDecoration, ProvideLinkedEditingRanges,\n  ProvideCallHierarchyIncomingCalls, ProvideCallHierarchyOutgoingCalls,\n  PrepareCallHierarchy, PrepareTypeHierarchy, ProvideTypeHierarchySupertypes,\n  ProvideTypeHierarchySubtypes)\n- Shared helpers InvokeProvider and InvokeProviderMethod also modularized\n- FeatureMethods.rs becomes a clean delegation layer\n\nTauri IPC Server (Source/IPC/TauriIPCServer/):\n- DecryptMessage, Dispose, InitializeDefaults, ProcessMessageQueue,\n  ReceiveMessage, SendMessage, StartHealthMonitoring, ValidatePermission\n- Core struct methods now single-line delegations\n\nCocoon Process Management (Source/ProcessManagement/CocoonManagement/):\n- 14 new modules covering full lifecycle: BuildCocoonEnvironment, CocoonProcessState,\n  ConnectToCocoonGrpc, FireRootConfigActivationEvents, FireWorkspaceContainsEvents,\n  HardKillCocoon, MonitorCocoonHealthTask, ResolveBootstrapScript,\n  RestoreWebviewPanels, SeedOpenDocuments, SeedOpenTerminals,\n  SendInitializationHandshake, SpawnCocoonIoForwarders, SpawnRestartHandler,\n  SpawnStartupActivationTask\n- Replaces ad-hoc inline logic with structured, testable units\n\nCocoon gRPC Service (Source/RPC/CocoonService/):\n- SpawnChannelReadPump extracted for bidirectional stream handling\n- CHANNEL_REGISTRY made pub(crate) for cross-module access\n\nImpact: Drastically improves maintainability, enables independent testing of each subsystem,\nand establishes consistent modular patterns for future Mountain development.",
			"SHA": "d0e13211efcd644d4a27bec1eed37d26d224e298"
		}
